 "name_en": "Period-End Closing – Maintenance Orders (BF7)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Period-End Closing – Maintenance Orders (BF7)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio1294fe4d2be249a3a8332f2ce742ec2a\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1294fe4d2be249a3a8332f2ce742ec2a__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item supports activities required for Reactive Maintenance (4HH) and Proactive Maintenance (4HI) scope items. Once the cost is recorded in order types YA01 (Reactive Maintenance), YA02 (Proactive Maintenance), YA03 (Improvement Maintenance), YA04 (Operational Maintenance), YA05 (Overhead Maintenance), YBA1 (Maintenance Order), YBA2 (Preventive Maintenance), and YBA3 (Unplanned Maintenance), this scope item is executed as a follow-up for settlement, closing and reporting.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1294fe4d2be249a3a8332f2ce742ec2a__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Settle service orders</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Close completed service orders</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">View order actuals</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1294fe4d2be249a3a8332f2ce742ec2a__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Process period-end closing quickly</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Report efficiently</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>期末关账 - 维护订单 (BF7)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio1294fe4d2be249a3a8332f2ce742ec2a\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1294fe4d2be249a3a8332f2ce742ec2a__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目支持被动维护 (4HH) 和主动维护 (4HI) 范围项目所需的活动。在订单类型 YA01（被动维护）、YA02（主动维护）、YA03（改进维护）、YA04（操作维护）、YA05（间接费用维护）、YBA1（维护订单）、YBA2（预防性维护）和 YBA3（计划外维护）中记录成本后，此范围项目将作为结算、关账和报表的后续执行。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1294fe4d2be249a3a8332f2ce742ec2a__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">结算服务订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">关闭完成的服务订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">查看订单实际值</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1294fe4d2be249a3a8332f2ce742ec2a__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">快速处理期末关账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">高效报告</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
